<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: Catfish escape -->
  <CatfishEscape.letterLabel>El silur s’ha escapat</CatfishEscape.letterLabel>
  <!-- EN: While attempting to wrangle a catfish, {PAWN_nameDef} stumbled and lost the slippery fish in the murky waters. -->
  <CatfishEscape.letterText>Quan {PAWN_nameDef} intentava capturar un silur, ha ensopegat i el peix se li ha escapat a les aigües tèrboles.</CatfishEscape.letterText>
  
  <!-- EN: Catfish spine -->
  <CatfishSpine.letterLabel>Espines de silur</CatfishSpine.letterLabel>
  <!-- EN: While handling a catfish, {PAWN_nameDef} was stung by one of the fish's toxic dorsal spines, causing {PAWN_objective} to drop the fish. -->
  <CatfishSpine.letterText>Quan {PAWN_nameDef} treia de l'aigua un silur, li ha picat amb una de les espines dorsals tòxiques i el peix se li ha escapat de les mans.</CatfishSpine.letterText>
  
  <!-- EN: Dogfish bite -->
  <DogfishBite.letterLabel>Mossegada de gató</DogfishBite.letterLabel>
  <!-- EN: While reeling in a dogfish, {PAWN_nameDef} was bitten.\n\nThe fish managed to escape. -->
  <DogfishBite.letterText>{PAWN_nameDef} ja recollia cable per a pescar un gató, però el peix li ha mossegat i se li ha escapat.</DogfishBite.letterText>
  
  <!-- EN: Dogfish escape -->
  <DogfishEscape.letterLabel>El gató s’ha escapat</DogfishEscape.letterLabel>
  <!-- EN: While reeling in a dogfish, {PAWN_nameDef} nearly bitten by the thrashing creature.\n\nThe fish escaped in the confusion. -->
  <DogfishEscape.letterText>Quan {PAWN_nameDef} recollia cable per a pescar un gató, el peix quasi li mossega.\n\nAl final el gató se li ha escapat.</DogfishEscape.letterText>
  
  <!-- EN: Flying frostfish -->
  <FrostfishAttack.letterLabel>Peix gel volador</FrostfishAttack.letterLabel>
  <!-- EN: While fishing, {PAWN_nameDef} was suddenly hit by a frostfish leaping out of the water. This caused {PAWN_objective} to lose {PAWN_possessive} catch. -->
  <FrostfishAttack.letterText>Mentre pescava, un peix gel ha saltat fora de l'aigua, li ha donat un cop a {PAWN_nameDef} i ha escapat.</FrostfishAttack.letterText>
  
  <!-- EN: Guppy escape -->
  <GuppyEscape.letterLabel>El gupi s’ha escapat</GuppyEscape.letterLabel>
  <!-- EN: While attempting to catch a guppy, {PAWN_nameDef} fumbled the small slippery fish, allowing it to escape. -->
  <GuppyEscape.letterText>A {PAWN_nameDef} li ha relliscat entre les mans el gupi que volia pescar i se li ha escapat.</GuppyEscape.letterText>
  
